#🔍 Diagnostic Analysis
In this project, it analyzes historical customer data to identify key factors influencing churn, 
such as customer behavior, service usage, and account characteristics. 
Feature importance from the Random Forest model helps diagnose which variables contribute most to customers leaving.

#🧭 Prescriptive Analysis
Based on the model’s insights, this analysis suggests targeted retention strategies, 
such as focusing on high-risk customer segments, improving specific services, 
or offering personalized incentives to customers with a higher probability of churn.
